WEBVTT

1
00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:19,250
I want to cry again Yaoyao

2
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:22,650
As long as you are strong enough, those who despise us will take the initiative to bow their heads.

3
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:24,380
Only strong enough

4
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:32,870
Only then can you protect your family, right? Brother, I know Brother Chu, and I will become stronger.

5
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:34,170
Prove that I'm not a dragster

6
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:37,880
In front is the college

7
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,380
I won’t accompany you to report.

8
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:47,580
Chu Wudai can't recognize his master. You guys have taken so much money.

9
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,680
Are you still afraid that your brother’s money was stolen?

10
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,320
Huaxiao in the city

11
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:54,820
It's much bigger than you think. If it's not enough, don't look for your parents.

12
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,020
Write to me

13
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:57,220
Without my protection

14
00:00:57,420 --> 00:00:58,420
Don't cry

15
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:02,780
Who is crying? Please be careful on the road, I promise.

16
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:04,080
Brother see us again

17
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,880
We must have gotten stronger
